            "body": "Upstreamed in libmpack/libmpack#51. That version adds one guard to `mpack_wnint`: tokens from `mpack_read` are not sign-extended, so a read int32 has `hi == 0` and should stay a 32-bit int when written back. I added the same guard here so the two copies match.",
